sentences.l:
But in silence feast, sitting, or else out of doors
weep, you two, having gone out, right here the bow leaving,
a harmless contest for the suitors;

Indeed of an arrow first to taste he was about
from the hands of blameless Odysseus, whom then he dishonoured,
sitting in the halls, and he urged on all his companions.
